The src folder contains all core classes for the Cinema Management System:

- Movie.java: Base class for all movie types.
- ActionMovie.java, ComedyMovie.java, RomanceMovie.java, SciFiMovie.java:
  Subclasses of Movie representing different genres.

- Staff.java: Base class for all staff members.
- TicketSeller.java: Staff role responsible for selling tickets.
- Manager.java: Staff role responsible for managing movie data.

- MovieManager.java: Handles loading, storing, and updating movie information.
- StaffManager.java: Handles login validation and staff account management.

- LoginPanel.java: UI panel for user login and role selection.
- Main.java: Program entry point that launches the main GUI.
